nts that enables acceptance of instore or online digital payments. These technology platforms and infrastructure allow merchants to accept debit cards, credit cards, prepaid instruments wallets, QR codes, unified payment interface (UPI), loyalty points, pay later, online fee collection, etc., as well as provide application programming interface (API) modules to customers for building financial products that facilitates bill payments, credit, and savings. It also engages in selling digital checkout points devices. The Issuing and Acquiring Platform segment provides a technology platform to issue, process, and distribute prepaid cards. It also monetizes by charging a processing fee from merchants who are utilizing the technology platform and in the case of distribution. The company was incorporated in 1998 and is based in Noida, India.","employees":5007,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795824860},"analyst":{"key":"strong_buy","mean":1.27273,"n":11,"tMean":220.45454,"tHigh":250,"tLow":190,"tMed":220,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795824860,"trend":{"strongBuy":1,"buy":9,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}},"cap":"Small","caFix":null,"fetched":1795824859,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Pine Labs\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Pine Labs launches AI agents for Indian SMBs","s":"The Paypers","d":1795796717,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPaTJTOFB6eTJLLXRyTm01ejVOV3hfX2hScmtyTC1QMGN2SlFMZ1JhWHdpVlVKVnFUdGNwcXR5TnNYZUNLVFRSb2Q5c2JHTHVvVTBpN2RzRWtrQnhYNHR5cURwbzNMbGdoNlBsbENNRkt6RU5ZbnpySFYzY0lQMUdpcTNMdmFIWVNwbVFPbDh2OUJoLUJiVmpVZ19XYVdsRTMt?oc=5","g":["plan"]},{"t":"Pine Labs Launches Guide and Marketer AI Agents for SMBs","s":"Elets BFSI","d":1795790854,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5UQ3dickhzY1ZnbnpuYWlsYnhPLTZNUkpRaVU3VHJNR0N1SnNhc3lXb2MxUWxHTmJoZUhfUGFYTFNtUElVSUlrR3F1Tmk3N0ZkOWFMcy1ueDF1amcwTlZZc05ma1YzZllMdEJZ?oc=5","g":["plan"]},{"t":"Pine Labs Adds AI A